xt{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_{\\mathsf{UG}}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{CSG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}noncontracting\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cup E:L\\in\\mathsf{CSL}_{\\Sigma}\\land E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\}\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}noncontracting\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cup E:L\\in\\mathsf{CSL}_{\\Sigma}\\land E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\}\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>按本书约定，非收缩文法从长度一的 S 出发不能生成 ε。带上标 ε 的类是这里显式加入空词选择后的扩展；不会无说明地把两个版本当成相等。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-unrestricted-grammar-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"92ebdfbfd367298c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-unrestricted-grammar-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-unrestricted-grammar-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"92ebdfbfd367298c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$、$G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}$。一般文法及语言见 [[73-df-unrestricted-grammar-semantics]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"G=(V,\\Sigma,P,S)\\in\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}noncontracting\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{CSG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\leftrightarrow\\forall(\\alpha,\\beta)\\in P\\;|\\alpha|\\le|\\beta|","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}noncontracting\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L_{\\mathsf{UG}}(G):G\\in\\mathsf{UG}_{\\Sigma}\\land\\operatorname{CSG}_{\\Sigma}(G)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}noncontracting\\text{-}grammar\\text{-}and\\text{-}csl}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{CSL}^{\\varepsilon}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\{L\\cup E:L\\in\\mathsf{CSL}_{\\Sigma}\\land E\\in\\{\\varnothing,\\{\\varepsilon\\}\\}\\}","display":true}],"bytes":2114,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-382","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl|非收缩文法与上下文有关语言]]"},{"id":"f2933d38e9d14eb7","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，$|\\Sigma|\\ge3$。所有语言类都取同一 $\\Sigma$；正则、CFL、CSL 的空词扩展、可判定与可识别类分别见 [[73-df-finite-automaton-language-class]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]、[[73-df-dtm-recognizable-languages]]、[[73-df-dtm-language-decision]]；CSL 的判定性见 [[73-thm-lba-finite-configuration-bound]]。"},{"id":"636ecdcceaa84a43","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$。三类语言见 [[73-df-indexed-language]]、[[73-df-cfg-language-class]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]；严格性的三块见证见 [[73-ex-indexed-equal-three-blocks]]。"},{"id":"f0b2b0bbfc242b92","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$；$L\\subseteq\\Sigma^*$。LBA 语言和 CSL 两版本见 [[73-df-linear-bounded-automaton]]、[[73-df-noncontracting-grammar-and-csl]]。"}],"outgoing":["92ebdfbfd367298c"]}